<title>USA: Southwest Bancshares Inc Q4 net down.</title>
<headline>Southwest Bancshares Inc Q4 net down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.33		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net			    910		    1,245</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,637		    2,993</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago earnings per share adjusted for three-for-two stock split in November, 1996. Q4 1996, 1995 primary and diluted earnings per share the same.</p>
